### 31.7.2 Changing the Pagesize

By default the pagesize is 10. In the code chunk below, argument
defaultPageSize is used to change the default setting.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true" code-summary="Show the code"}
reactable(
  report,
  defaultPageSize = 13,
  columns = list(
    Product = colDef(maxWidth = 200),
    `Monthly Sales` = colDef(
      cell = react_sparkline(report)
    )
  )
)
```

