### 31.7.3 Adding Points and Labels

In the code chunk below `highlight_points` argument is used to show the
minimum and maximum values points and `label` argument is used to label
first and last values.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true" code-summary="Show the code"}
reactable(
  report,
  defaultPageSize = 13,
  columns = list(
    Product = colDef(maxWidth = 200),
    `Monthly Sales` = colDef(
      cell = react_sparkline(
        report,
        highlight_points = highlight_points(
          min = "red", max = "blue"),
        labels = c("first", "last")
        )
    )
  )
)
```

