### 31.7.4 Adding Reference Line

In the code chunk below  `statline`  argument is used to show the mean
line.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true" code-summary="Show the code"}
reactable(
  report,
  defaultPageSize = 13,
  columns = list(
    Product = colDef(maxWidth = 200),
    `Monthly Sales` = colDef(
      cell = react_sparkline(
        report,
        highlight_points = highlight_points(
          min = "red", max = "blue"),
        statline = "mean"
        )
    )
  )
)
```

